{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2017-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1492905600, "end_date": 1493596799, "month_true_total": 63, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:13:01 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "31474628", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095006508", "personaname": "Renix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198095006508/", "num_games_owned": 94, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 169, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 169, "last_played": 1493593643, "avatar": "f042957fc21fd73079312ce9148afbe3167134fc"}, "language": "english", "review": "iz nice game luv it\n\nit s a nice coop game.", "timestamp_created": 1493592801, "timestamp_updated": 1493592801, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "31455150", "author": {"steamid": "76561198115778822", "personaname": "DeltaRidley", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/deltaridley/", "num_games_owned": 778, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4125, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3787, "last_played": 1576895705, "avatar": "9aec9d00a0ba61646a00b90aa3f7058e27b0f274"}, "language": "english", "review": "man this game is really fun, fast paced, and exciting. i love it", "timestamp_created": 1493526605, "timestamp_updated": 1493526605, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "31450818", "author": {"steamid": "76561198121735483", "personaname": "JRYVYN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jryvyn/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 10020, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6286, "last_played": 1685565222, "avatar": "059f27b9bdf15392d8b0114d8d106bd430398cf2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Over 100 hours of gameplay, alone and with friends, and this game still finds ways to surprise and impress me.\nAll of the characters are fun, unique, balanced, and difficult to unlock excepting the Commando, who you start with.\nGreat pace, and the timer makes you choose between farming, or finishing the level and moving on. Both are viable options in every game.\nMy biggest complaint? THEY DROPPED THE MULTIPLAYER\nI mean, yes. It's pretty easy to set up a LAN with your friends, especially with Hamachi, but the multiplayer used to be so quick, and had a great community surrounding it. The multiplayer was co-op and you had the choice between forced item sharing, or first come first serve.\nI had lots of great times, and the multiplayer is what drew me into this game. While I can still have plenty of fun with it solo, especially on harder difficulties, I'll be disappointed every single time I open the game and try to join a multiplayer game.", "timestamp_created": 1493505967, "timestamp_updated": 1493505967, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518716573715209961", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "31442380", "author": {"steamid": "76561198124699110", "personaname": "Grifter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198124699110/", "num_games_owned": 82, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 826, "play